{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p001274","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p001274"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p001274","label":"季武子（魯卿）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"季武子","mention_ids":["c-shiji-033-lu:m065-0017","c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0076","c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0043"]},{"surface":"武子","mention_ids":["c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0047"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m065-0017","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p065","quote":"季武子"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0076","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p072","quote":"季武子"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0043","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p073","quote":"季武子"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0047","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p078","quote":"武子"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","mention_count":4,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-033-lu:m065-0017","c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0076","c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0043","c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0047"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-033-lu:p065","c-shiji-033-lu:p072","c-shiji-033-lu:p073","c-shiji-033-lu:p078"],"passage_count":4}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-033-lu"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m065-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"季武子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001274","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p065","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0076","start":76,"end":79,"surface":"季武子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001274","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p072","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"季武子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001274","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p073","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"武子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001274","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p078","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji033-145","person_id":"cbr-p001274","surfaces":["季武子","武子"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-033-lu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p065","quote":"九年，與晉伐鄭。晉悼公冠襄公於衛，季武子從，相行禮。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p072","quote":"昭公年十九，猶有童心。穆叔不欲立，曰：『太子死，有母弟可立，不即立長。年鈞擇賢，義鈞則卜之。今裯非適嗣，且又居喪意不在戚而有喜色，若果立，必爲季氏憂。』季武子弗聽，卒立之。比及葬，三易衰。君子曰：『是不終也。』"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p073","quote":"昭公三年，朝晉至河，晉平公謝還之，魯恥焉。四年，楚靈王會諸矦於申，昭公稱病不往。七年，季武子卒。八年，楚靈王就章華臺，召昭公。昭公往賀，賜昭公寶器；已而悔，復詐取之。十二年，朝晉至河，晉平公謝還之。十三年，楚公子棄疾弒其君靈王，代立。十五年，朝晉，晉留之葬晉昭公，魯恥之。二十年，齊景公與晏子狩竟，因入魯問禮。二十一年，朝晉至河，晉謝還之。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p078","quote":"定公立，趙簡子問史墨曰：『季氏亡乎？』史墨對曰：『不亡。季友有大功於魯，受鄪爲上卿，至于文子、武子，世增其業。魯文公卒，東門遂殺適立庶，魯君於是失國政。政在季氏，於今四君矣。民不知君，何以得國！是以爲君慎器與名，不可以假人。』"}],"rationale":"按文公以後立嗣、昭公出奔、夾谷會盟、徵百牢與魯君世系的具體事件及國別暫定異稱，後期同爵稱不與先君混同。身份、匿名指代與數位疑讀待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p065","text":"九年，與晉伐鄭。晉悼公冠襄公於衛，季武子從，相行禮。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m065-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"晉悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000261","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m065-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001273","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m065-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"季武子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001274","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p072","text":"昭公年十九，猶有童心。穆叔不欲立，曰：『太子死，有母弟可立，不即立長。年鈞擇賢，義鈞則卜之。今裯非適嗣，且又居喪意不在戚而有喜色，若果立，必爲季氏憂。』季武子弗聽，卒立之。比及葬，三易衰。君子曰：『是不終也。』","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001178","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"穆叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001277","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001276","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"母弟","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001278","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"裯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001178","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"季氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、論贊署稱、地點氏稱或未定指代；不補姓名、爵位與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0076","start":76,"end":79,"surface":"季武子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001274","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"君子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、論贊署稱、地點氏稱或未定指代；不補姓名、爵位與成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p073","text":"昭公三年，朝晉至河，晉平公謝還之，魯恥焉。四年，楚靈王會諸矦於申，昭公稱病不往。七年，季武子卒。八年，楚靈王就章華臺，召昭公。昭公往賀，賜昭公寶器；已而悔，復詐取之。十二年，朝晉至河，晉平公謝還之。十三年，楚公子棄疾弒其君靈王，代立。十五年，朝晉，晉留之葬晉昭公，魯恥之。二十年，齊景公與晏子狩竟，因入魯問禮。二十一年，朝晉至河，晉謝還之。","annotation_sta